  "description": "IQUWAU crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C40 H66 Dy6 N12 O26 8+,6(C1 H4 O1),2(C2 H3 N1),8(Br1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.485-3.509 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.72-101.31°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C50H96Br8Dy6N14O32. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 12 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
